# Binaries: never normalise line endings, never treat as text.
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
*.exe binary
*.nupkg binary
*.wasm binary
*.gz binary
*.br binary
*.db binary
*.vsidx binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Line-ending normalisation is deliberately NOT enabled yet. The tree still has CRLF
# files tracked from a Windows editor round-trip, so switching on `text=auto` would
# renormalise them all in one commit and bury the real change. Do it separately, when
# nothing else is in flight, with `git add --renormalize .`.
